### Frontpage API — manual requests
# JetBrains IDEs: click ▶ next to a request and pick an environment (local / railway).
# VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then "Send Request".
# Environments live in http-client.env.json (committed, no secrets).
# Put tokens in http-client.private.env.json (git-ignored).
# Start the backend first: `bun run dev:backend` from the repo root.

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### CORS — allowed origin (expect Access-Control-Allow-Origin in the response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### CORS — disallowed origin (expect no Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: https://evil.example

### Unknown route → JSON 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist

### Malformed JSON body → JSON 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

{ not json

### Fetch a feed (RSS 2.0) → normalized JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch?url=https://css-tricks.com/feed/
Accept: application/json

### Fetch an Atom feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch?url=https://vercel.com/atom
Accept: application/json

### Conditional fetch → 304 when the feed is unchanged (paste the ETag from the previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch?url=https://vercel.com/atom
If-None-Match: "paste-etag-here"

### Dead feed → 502 { error: { code: "http_4xx", retryable: false } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch?url=https://example.com/this-feed-does-not-exist.xml

### Not a feed → 422 { error: { code: "not_a_feed" } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch?url=https://example.com/

### Missing url → 400 { error: { code: "invalid_url" } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fetch

### Auth — sign up (email + password; sets the session cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "password": "correct horse battery", "name": "Ada" }

### Auth — sign in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "password": "correct horse battery" }

### Auth — current session (null when signed out; 503 without a database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session

### Auth — request a password reset (without RESEND_API_KEY the link is logged by the backend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/request-password-reset
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "redirectTo": "http://localhost:3000/reset-password" }

### Auth — sign out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-out
Origin: http://localhost:3000
